{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪君の名は希望\nデイリーチャート1位！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいかぎりです。\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もこの曲だいすき！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真撮影のとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愉快な乃木坂。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は恋愛禁止だけど、こんなに\n可愛いなら中高とモテてましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モテてません！\nでもそんな自分がいいから、\nこれでいいのだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超能力がもらえるなら\nどんな超能力が欲しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を止めるスペック。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近作った料理教えてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蒸しパン\nキャベツとベーコンのパスタ\nけっこう料理頑張ってるだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ところでパーフェクト\nガウッチって何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書道の選択肢がパーフェクトか\nガウッチだったみたい！\nいろんなこと想像してみてください。\n私が答えるより楽しいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレター書いたらちゃんと\n読んでくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手元に届くのは遅くなりますが、\n届いたらしっかり読みます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーでピュアだなって人は誰？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま、まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズム特訓のシーンで\nドアの外にいるのはまりおくんと、\n深川くんと、かず男くん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人は生駒の友人で\nかなりんとさゆにゃんもドア越しで\n見守っていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張個握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみなのね～ふふふふ\nみなさんに久しぶりに会える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張、今までは午後からが\n多かったけど今回は1部～3部。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅刻しないでね？笑\n待ってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n今日のわたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/15/5429738/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔がこわい。メイク濃くみえる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛この調子でのばしていこう。\nふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}